# ── BMad runtime ────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Managed by the bmad plugin (bmad-init) — do not edit by hand.
# The _bmad/ runtime is a cache synced to the installed plugin version on
# session start. Only the config layer below is committed; everything else
# is regenerated to match the installed plugin version.
*
!.gitignore
!config.toml
!custom/
!custom/**
!bmm/
!bmm/config.yaml
!core/
!core/config.yaml
# personal install answers stay out of git
config.user.toml
custom/*.user.toml
